('fertile', 'tip', 'Ovulation predictor kit', 'OPK detect LH surge. Pee on stick, baca dalam 5 menit. 95% accurate kalau pas kalibrasi.', '📍', 40),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Maintain healthy weight', 'BMI ekstrem (under/over) bisa disrupt ovulasi. Healthy range = regular cycles + better fertility.', '⚖️', 41),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Quit smoking', 'Smoking accelerate ovarian aging. Tiap pack-year = AMH (egg reserve) marker turun.', '🚭', 42),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Sleep 7-9 jam', 'Sleep deprivation disrupt LH surge timing. Konsepsi harder kalau chronic sleep loss.', '😴', 43),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Stress management', 'Cortisol tinggi delay ovulasi. Yoga, meditation, walk in nature — anything yang lo find calming.', '🧘', 44),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Sexual frequency', 'Konsepsi: every 1-2 days di fertile window optimal. Daily OK juga, sperm count recover cepat.', '🛏️', 45),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Position myth', 'No scientific evidence position pengaruhi konsepsi probability. Whatever feels good.', '💫', 46),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Post-coital rest', 'Lying flat 10-15 menit post-sex bisa bantu sperm reach cervix. Anecdotal tapi harmless.', '🛌', 47),
('fertile', 'tip', 'Mood awareness', 'Some experience hyper-aware, others slightly anxious due to body changes. Both normal.', '🤔', 48),
